  "id": "braised-beef-shank-with-tomato-and-herbs",
  "name": "Braised Beef Shank with Tomato and Herbs",
  "subtitle": "A slow-simmered tomato braise for two",
  "description": "Beef shank cooks with tomato, aromatics, and dried herbs until tender and richly flavored.",
